  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to smallholder livestock farmers through FFSs and development of the national cattle breeding strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One of the objectives of this project is increased local capacity for cattle breeding through the development of a national cattle breeding strategy. This project will also strengthen community ties and foster collaborative efforts among farmers and local advisory services through Farmer Field School (FFS) approach aiming at creating a more resilient and supportive farming community where knowledge and resources are shared for mutual benefit.</narrative>
  </description>
